  "non_executable": [
    {
      "section": "cache_persistence_posture",
      "reason": "The cache is deliberately NOT persisted across process restart or engine reconfiguration: persisting would write provider-issued encrypted_content into a durable store and require a schema plus migration, and buys nothing because _insert_reasoning_items already ships calls with no captured item. That is a design decision about code that does not exist; there is no observable behavior to assert."
    }
